# What the CLI must not upload.
#
# Vercel builds from source, so anything generated here is dead weight -- and
# the videos are 239MB that live in the WordPress media library now, not in
# this repo. Uploading them is what made `vercel --prod` abort.

node_modules/
dist/
dist-ssr/
.prerender-template.html

# Served from WordPress uploads; see src/home/media.js.
public/videos/
